        "text": "**HYPERMORPHIC FURY**\n\nAdd 1 to Charge rolls made for **ABERRANTS**, **BIOPHAGUS** and **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** units from your army. In addition, each time such a unit is selected to fight, if it made a Charge move this turn, until the end of the phase, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit."
      },
