        "text": "**RAPID TAKEOVER**\n\nWhile a **GENESTEALER CULTS MOUNTED**/**VEHICLE** model from your army is not Battle-shocked, add 1 to its Objective Control characteristic. In addition, at the end of your Command phase, if one or more **ATALAN JACKALS** units from your army are within range of an **objective** you control, that **objective** remains under your control until your opponent’s Level of Control over that objective marker is greater than yours at the end of a phase."
      },
