        "text": "**UNQUESTIONING FANATICISM**\n\nFor each **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** and **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit from your army, while one or more **CHARACTER** models are leading that unit, you can re‐roll Advance and Charge rolls made for it. If that **CHARACTER** model is a **MAGUS**, **PRIMUS** or **ACOLYTE ICONWARD**, that model has the Feel No Pain 3+ ability while leading that unit."
