      "Stratagem§A Dark Network": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Brood Brothers Auxilia"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Reinforcements step of your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit is set up on the battlefield from Reserves.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASTRA MILITARUM** or **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit from your army (excluding **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**) within 12\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§A Deadly Snare": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Host of Ascension"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Charge phase, just after an enemy unit declares a charge.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS INFANTRY** unit from your army that was selected as a target of that charge.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll one D6: on a 2-4, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds; on a 5+, that enemy unit suffers 3 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Acceptable Losses": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Brood Brothers Auxilia"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit within Engagement Range of one or more **GENESTEALER CULTS** units from your army. Until the end of the phase, your unit can make ranged attacks that target that enemy unit. If it does, after it has resolved those attacks, roll one D6 for each of those **GENESTEALER CULTS** units: on a 5+, the unit being rolled for suffers D3+1 mortal wounds."
      },
      "Stratagem§Along Shadowed Trails": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Outlander Claw"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of one or more of your Cult Ambush markers.\n\n**TARGET:** Select one of those Cult Ambush markers.\n\n**EFFECT:** You can set up that Cult Ambush marker anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8\" horizontally away from all enemy units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Avenge the Star Children": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Final Day"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has shot or fought.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TYRANIDS CHARACTER** unit from your army that was destroyed by that enemy unit this phase. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the battle, each time a **GENESTEALER CULTS** model from your army makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, add 1 to the Hit roll and add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Bio-horror Revelation": {
        "keywords": {
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Biosanctic Broodsurge"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your opponent’s Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ABERRANTS**, **BIOPHAGUS** or **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an enemy unit within 9\" of your unit is selected to shoot, it must take a Leadership test, subtracting 1 from the result. If that test is failed, until the end of the phase, each time a model in that enemy unit makes an attack that targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Close-range Shoot-out": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Outlander Claw"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS MOUNTED** or **GENESTEALER CULTS VEHICLE** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[LETHAL HITS]** ability while targeting an enemy unit within 18\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Coordinated Trap": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Host of Ascension"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** The start of your Shooting phase or the start of the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** Two **GENESTEALER CULTS** units from your army that have not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit (if this Stratagem is used in the Fight phase, that enemy unit must be within Engagement Range of both of your units). Until the end of the phase, each time a model in either of your units makes an attack, it can only target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target for that attack), and when resolving that attack, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Darting Attacks": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Final Day"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TYRANIDS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, your unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back."
      },
      "Stratagem§Deft Manoeuvring": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Outlander Claw"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ACHILLES RIDGERUNNERS** or **ATALAN JACKALS** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, models in your unit have a 4+ invulnerable save."
      },
      "Stratagem§Devoted Crew": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Outlander Claw"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit has selected its targets.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GOLIATH ROCKGRINDER** or **GOLIATH TRUCK** unit from your army that was selected as the target of one or more of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time an attack targets your unit, subtract 1 from the Damage characteristic of that attack."
      },
      "Stratagem§Divine Imperative": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Final Day"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase, when a friendly **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit within 12\" of a friendly **engaged** **TYRANIDS** unit **declares a charge**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** - Your unit has +1 to **charge rolls**.\n\n- You can use this part of this **stratagem**. If you do:\n\n- Your unit can re-roll **charge rolls**.\n\n- Your unit __must__ end that **charge move** **engaged** with an enemy unit **engaged** with that friendly **TYRANIDS** unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Encircling the Prey": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Outlander Claw"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS MOUNTED** or **GENESTEALER CULTS VEHICLE** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units and is wholly within 9\" of one or more battlefield edges.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Evasive Vanguard": {
        "keywords": {
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Biosanctic Broodsurge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of one or more of your Cult Ambush markers, before removing those markers from the battlefield.\n\n**TARGET:** Select one of those Cult Ambush markers.\n\n**EFFECT:** You can set up that Cult Ambush marker anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8\" horizontally away from all enemy units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Frenzied Devotion": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocreed Congregation"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, improve the Attacks and Weapon Skill characteristics of melee weapons equipped by models (excluding **CHARACTERS**) in your unit by 1 and those weapons have the **[HAZARDOUS]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Gene-twisted Muscle": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Biosanctic Broodsurge"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ABERRANTS**, **BIOPHAGUS** or **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets a **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE**, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hyper-metabolic Vigour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Biosanctic Broodsurge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ABERRANTS**, **BIOPHAGUS** or **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes a Pile-in or Consolidation move, it can move up to 6\" instead of up to 3\". In addition, it does not need to end that move closer to the closest enemy model, provided it ends it as close as possible to the closest enemy unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Hyperferocity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Final Day"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit from your army that has not been selected to fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack that targets an enemy unit, re-roll a Wound roll of 1. If one or more friendly **TYRANIDS** units are within 6\" of that enemy unit, you can re-roll the Wound roll instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§In the Shadow of Iron": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Brood Brothers Auxilia"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Any phase, just after an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of one or more of your Cult Ambush markers.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASTRA MILITARUM VEHICLE** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one of those Cult Ambush markers. You can set up that Cult Ambush marker anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8\" horizontally away from all enemy units and wholly within 6\" of your unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Lying in Wait": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Host of Ascension"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS BATTLELINE** unit from your army in Cult Ambush.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, when setting your unit up using a Cult Ambush marker, set your unit up anywhere on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of that Cult Ambush marker and not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units."
      },
      "Stratagem§Primed and Readied": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Host of Ascension"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS** units from your army that has not been selected to shoot or fight this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, each time a model in your unit makes an attack, a Critical Hit is scored on an unmodified Hit roll of 5+, instead of only a 6."
      },
      "Stratagem§Psi Surge": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Final Day"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Any"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of any phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **TYRANIDS** unit from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the start of your next Command phase, increase the range of your unit’s Catalyst ability by 3.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** Each time you use this Stratagem, until the end of your next Command phase, you cannot use this Stratagem again."
      },
      "Stratagem§Rapid Feint": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Outlander Claw"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, just after an enemy unit ends a Normal, Advance or Fall Back move.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ACHILLES RIDGERUNNERS** or **ATALAN JACKALS** unit from your army that is within 8\" of that enemy unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a Normal move of up to 6\"."
      },
      "Stratagem§Regimental Reinforcements": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Brood Brothers Auxilia"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY REGIMENT** unit from your army (excluding **ARTILLERY** and **CHARACTER** units) is destroyed.\n\n**TARGET:** That **INFANTRY** unit. You can use this Stratagem on that unit even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll one D6: on a 3+, place one Cult Ambush marker anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 8\" horizontally away from all enemy units (if this is not possible, no marker is placed) and add a new unit to your army identical to your destroyed unit, in Cult Ambush, at its Starting Strength, with all of its wounds remaining and any **[ONE SHOT]** weapons those models are equipped with considered as not having been shot.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** You can only use this Stratagem once per battle."
      },
      "Stratagem§Resistance Tunnels": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Final Day"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS** or **TYRANIDS** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Return To the Shadows": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Host of Ascension"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Fight phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS INFANTRY** unit from your army that is not within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units.\n\n**EFFECT:** Remove your unit from the battlefield and place it into Strategic Reserves."
      },
      "Stratagem§Saintly Paroxysm": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Biosanctic Broodsurge"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, just after an enemy unit destroys a **GENESTEALER CULTS CHARACTER** model from your army.\n\n**TARGET:** That destroyed **CHARACTER** model. You can use this Stratagem on that model even though it was just destroyed.\n\n**EFFECT:** Roll one D6: on a 2+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds. If that **CHARACTER** model is an **ABOMINANT** or **PATRIARCH**, that enemy unit suffers 2D3 mortal wounds instead."
      },
      "Stratagem§Stimulated Bio-surge": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Biosanctic Broodsurge"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ABERRANTS**, **BIOPHAGUS** or **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit from your army that has not declared a charge this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has +2 to **charge rolls**."
      },
      "Stratagem§Suppress and Overwhelm": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Brood Brothers Auxilia"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, just after an **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit from your army has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** That **ASTRA MILITARUM** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit hit by one or more of those attacks. Until the end of the turn, that enemy unit cannot be targeted with the Fire Overwatch Stratagem and each time a **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit from your army selects that enemy unit as a target of a charge, you can re-roll the Charge roll."
      },
      "Stratagem§Symbiotic Destruction": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Battle Tactic"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Brood Brothers Auxilia"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ASTRA MILITARUM** and one **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit from your army that have not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit that is visible to both of those selected units and within range of at least one ranged weapon from each of those units. Until the end of the phase, models in those units can only make attacks that target that enemy unit (and only if it is an eligible target). When doing so, each time such a model makes an attack, re-roll a Wound roll of 1."
      },
      "Stratagem§The Downtrodden Rise": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocreed Congregation"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        },
        "stats": {
          "Command Cost": {
            "value": 2
          }
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** End of your opponent’s Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit from your army in Cult Ambush.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, you can set up your unit on the battlefield without using a Cult Ambush marker. When doing so, set up your unit anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy units."
      },
      "Stratagem§The Path of Anguish": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocreed Congregation"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, just after an enemy unit has shot.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit from your army that had one or more of its models destroyed as a result of the attacking unit’s attacks.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a move of up to D6\", but it unit must end that move as close as possible to the closest enemy unit (excluding **AIRCRAFT**). When doing so, models in your unit can be moved within Engagement Range of that enemy unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Tireless Fervour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocreed Congregation"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Charge"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Charge phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit from your army that has not declared a charge this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** -  If your unit made an **advance**/**fall-back move** this turn, that **advance**/**fall-back move** does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to declare a charge**.\n\n- When your unit **declares a charge**, you can use this part of this **stratagem**. If you do:\n\n- Your unit can re-roll **charge rolls**.\n\n- Your unit __must__ end that **charge move engaged** with an enemy unit **engaged** with a friendly **CHARACTER** unit."
      },
      "Stratagem§Transcendent Celerity": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocreed Congregation"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit from your army that has not been selected to shoot this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the phase, ranged weapons equipped by models in your unit have the **[ASSAULT]** ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Tunnel Crawlers": {
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Host of Ascension"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ],
          "Category": [
            "Strategic Ploy"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit from your army that is arriving using the Deep Strike ability this phase.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can be set up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 6\" horizontally away from all enemy units.\n\n**RESTRICTIONS:** A unit targeted by this Stratagem is not eligible to declare a charge in the same turn."
      },
      "Stratagem§Vengeance for the Martyr!": {
        "keywords": {
          "Category": [
            "Epic Deed"
          ],
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocreed Congregation"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, just after an enemy unit destroys a **GENESTEALER CULTS CHARACTER** model from your army.\n\n**TARGET:** One other **GENESTEALER CULTS CHARACTER** model from your army.\n\n**EFFECT:** Until the end of the battle, each time a friendly **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** model makes an attack that targets that enemy unit, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. If the destroyed model was a **MAGUS**, **PRIMUS** or **ACOLYTE ICONWARD**, you can re-roll the Hit roll instead."
      },
