      "Wargear§Alchemicus Familiar": {
        "text": "Once per battle, when the bearer’s unit is selected to fight, the bearer can use its alchemicus familiar. If it does, until the end of the phase, each time the bearer's unit makes an attack that targets an **Infantry** unit, add 1 to the Wound roll."
      },
      "Wargear§Cult Icon": {
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can return up to 3 destroyed models to the bearer's unit. If the bearer's unit is within range of an objective marker you control, you can return up to D3+3 destroyed models to that unit instead. This ability cannot be used to return destroyed **Character** models in Attached units and any [ONE SHOT] weapons equipped by returned models that were shot before they were destroyed are still considered to have been shot."
      },
      "Wargear§Cult Icon (Hybrid and Acolyte)": {
        "aspects": {
          "Label": "Cult Icon"
        },
        "text": "In your Command phase, you can return up to D3 destroyed models to the bearer's unit. If the bearer's unit is within range of an objective marker you control, you can return up to 3 destroyed models to that unit instead. This ability cannot be used to return destroyed **Character** models in Attached units and any [ONE SHOT] weapons equipped by returned models that were shot before they were destroyed are still considered to have been shot."
      },
      "Wargear§Flare Launcher": {
        "rules": {
          "addSmokeKeyword": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "add",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "keywords",
                    "Keywords"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Smoke"
              }
            ],
            "evals": [],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass"
          }
        },
        "text": "The bearer’s unit has the Smoke keyword and you can target it with the Smokescreen Strategem for 0CP."
      },
      "Wargear§Spotter": {
        "rules": {
          "setBallisticSkill": {
            "actions": [
              {
                "actionType": "set",
                "iterations": 1,
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "assets",
                    "classification",
                    "Ranged Weapon",
                    "stats",
                    "BS",
                    "value"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": 3
              }
            ],
            "evals": [],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "pass"
          }
        },
        "text": "The bearer’s ranged weapons have a Ballistic Skill characteristic of 3+."
      },
      "Wargear§Survey Augur": {
        "text": "Each time the bearer’s unit has shot, select one enemy unit that was hit by one or more attacks made by the bearer this phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly Genestealer Cults model makes an attack against that unit, that attack has the [IGNORES COVER] ability."
      },
      "Stratagem§Inhuman Reactions": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of a friendly **unengaged** **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit can make a **normal move** of up to D3+3\".",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Purestrain Broodswarm"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Crawling Horror": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your opponent’s Movement phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Your unit has -6\" **detection range** until the end of the turn.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Purestrain Broodswarm"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Lurk and Strike": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Movement phase, when a friendly **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit is selected to make a **fall-back move**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** That move does not prevent your unit from being **eligible to declare a charge**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Purestrain Broodswarm"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Movement"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Surging Broodworship": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly **KILLER** unit is **selected to attack**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KILLER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Attacks made by **KILLER** models in your unit have **[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Heroes Of The Uprising"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Loyal to the End": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **KILLER** unit.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KILLER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** When a **KILLER** model in your unit is **destroyed**, if your unit has not been **selected to fight** this phase, roll one D6: \n\n- On a 1, that enemy unit suffers 1 **mortal wound**.\n\n- On a 2+, do not remove that model from the battlefield. When your unit has fought, or at the end of the phase (whichever comes first), that model is removed from the battlefield.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Heroes Of The Uprising"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Living up to Legend": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly **KILLER** unit has **attacked**, if those attacks **destroyed** an enemy unit or an enemy **CHARACTER** model.\n\n**TARGET:** That **KILLER** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Each **visible** friendly **battle-shocked** **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit within 12\" of your unit is no longer **battle-shocked**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Heroes Of The Uprising"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours",
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Fight",
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Slunk from the Underbelly": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit with every model within a **terrain area**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 **AP** until that unit has attacked.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocult Masses"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Opponent’s"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Eyes of the Cult": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Start of your Shooting phase.\n\n**TARGET:** One friendly **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit within a **terrain area**.\n\n**EFFECT:** Enemy units within that **terrain area** have +6\" **detection range**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocult Masses"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
      "Stratagem§Fanatical Hail": {
        "text": "**WHEN:** Your Shooting phase, when a friendly **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit is **selected to shoot**.\n\n**TARGET:** That **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit.\n\n**EFFECT:** Select one enemy unit. Your unit’s ranged attacks that target that enemy unit can re-roll **hit rolls**.",
        "keywords": {
          "Keywords": [
            "Genestealer Cults",
            "Xenocult Masses"
          ],
          "Turn": [
            "Yours"
          ],
          "Phase": [
            "Shooting"
          ]
        }
      },
