      "Ability§Heroic Fusillade": {
        "text": "Once per turn, after one model from your army with this ability has shot, you can select one **INFANTRY** unit hit by one or more of those attacks. That unit must take a Battle-shock test."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Guerrillas": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a ranged attack targets this unit, this unit has the Benefit of Cover against that attack."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Insurgents": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per turn, if this unit is wholly within a terrain feature, you can target this unit with the Fire Overwatch or Heroic Intervention Stratagem for 0CP."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Insurrectionists": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Infantry"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit is selected to shoot, if you select the closest enemy unit as the target of all of those attacks, add 1 to the Hit roll when resolving each of those attacks. In addition, each time a model in this unit makes a melee attack, add 1 to the Hit roll."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Xenos Savagery": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Patriarch",
            "Acolyte Hybrids",
            "Hybrid Metamorphs",
            "Purestrain Genestealers"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, this unit can use this Battle Trait. If it does, until the end of the phase, this unit has the Fights First ability."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Elusive Raiders": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Mounted",
            "Vehicle"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Models in this unit have a 5+ invulnerable save against ranged attacks."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Charged Engines": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Mounted",
            "Vehicle"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Advances, do not make an Advance roll. Instead, until the end of the phase, add 6\" to the Move characteristic of models in this unit."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Ablative Plating": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Mounted",
            "Vehicle"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time an attack targets this unit, worsen the Armour Penetration of that attack by 1 (to a minimum of 0)."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Unbreakable Bond": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Character"
          ]
        },
        "text": "When this model gains this Battle Trait, select one **^^Genestealer Cults^^** unit on your Order of Battle for this model to form an unbreakable bond with. While this model is leading that unit, once per turn, you can re-roll one Hit roll, one Wound roll or one saving throw made for that unit."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Fast Reflexes": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Patriarch",
            "Acolyte Hybrids",
            "Hybrid Metamorphs",
            "Purestrain Genestealers"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time a melee attack targets this unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Aggressive Strain": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Patriarch",
            "Acolyte Hybrids",
            "Hybrid Metamorphs",
            "Purestrain Genestealers"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this unit Piles In or Consolidates, models in this unit can move an additional 2\"."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Brood Prophet (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Character"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Improve this model's Leadership characteristic by 1. While a friendly **^^Genestealer Cults^^** unit is within 12\" of and visible to this model, models in that unit can use this model's Leadership characteristic instead of their own."
      },
      "Battle Trait§Synaptic Impetus": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Character"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time this model makes an attack, add 1 to the Hit roll if this model is leading a unit of 5 or more models, and 1 to the Wound roll as well if this model is leading a unit of 10 or more models."
      },
      "Crusade Relic§Reverberation Coil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Antiquity Relic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Improve the Leadership characteristic of models in the bearer's unit by 2. Each time the bearer's unit fails a Leadership test, the bearer suffers 1 mortal wound.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Crusade Relic§The Magorran Logs": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Antiquity Relic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time you select the bearer's unit as the target of a Battle Tactic Stratagem, you can select one other unit within 12\" of the bearer's unit that is also an eligible target for that Stratagem; that selected unit is also affected by that Stratagem.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Crusade Relic§Sedition Field (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Legendary Relic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "While an enemy **^^Battleline^^** unit is within 9\" of the bearer's unit, worsen the Leadership characteristic of models in that enemy unit by 1, and subtract 1 from the Objective Control characteristic of models in that enemy unit (to a minimum of 0).",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "Crusade Relic§Pennant of Ascension (Aura)": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Legendary Relic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**^^Acolyte Iconward^^** model only. While a friendly **^^Genestealer Cults Infantry^^** or **^^Genestealer Cults Mounted^^** unit is within 6\" of the bearer, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in that unit.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 3
          }
        },
        "rules": {
          "Acolyte Iconward only.": {
            "evals": [
              {
                "actionable": true,
                "contains": true,
                "not": false,
                "operator": "AND",
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "keywords",
                    "Keywords"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Acolyte Iconward"
              }
            ],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "error"
          }
        }
      },
      "Crusade Relic§Vector Talon": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Artificer Relic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Improve the Armour Penetration and Damage characteristics of melee weapons equipped by the bearer by 1."
      },
      "Crusade Relic§Pervasion Veil": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Artificer Relic"
          ]
        },
        "text": "**^^Infantry^^** model (excluding **^^Patriarch^^** models) only. Add 3\" to the bearer's Move characteristic, and the bearer gains the following ability: **Pervasion Veil:** Once per battle, at the end of any phase, provided this model is not leading a unit, it can use this ability. If it does, remove it from the battlefield and set it up again anywhere on the battlefield more than 9\" horizontally away from all enemy units.",
        "rules": {
          "Infantry only (not Patriarch).": {
            "evals": [
              {
                "actionable": true,
                "contains": true,
                "not": false,
                "operator": "AND",
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "keywords",
                    "Keywords"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Infantry"
              },
              {
                "actionable": true,
                "contains": true,
                "not": true,
                "operator": "AND",
                "paths": [
                  [
                    "{parent}",
                    "keywords",
                    "Keywords"
                  ]
                ],
                "value": "Patriarch"
              }
            ],
            "evaluate": "AND",
            "failState": "error"
          }
        }
      },
      "Battle Scar§Gene Affliction": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Genestealer Cults"
          ]
        },
        "text": "- Subtract 1 from the Toughness characteristic of this model. - Worsen the Weapon Skill and Ballistic Skill characteristics of weapons equipped by this model by 1."
      },
      "Battle Scar§Out Of Favour": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Genestealer Cults"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time you allocate an attack to a model in this model's unit, you must allocate it to this model."
      },
      "Battle Scar§Relearn the Creed": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Genestealer Cults"
          ]
        },
        "text": "You cannot target this model's unit with Stratagems other than Core Stratagems."
      },
      "Battle Scar§In The Shadow Of Your Betters": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Genestealer Cults"
          ]
        },
        "text": "- This model cannot be attached to a unit that has another model attached to it, and no other models can be attached to a unit this model is attached to. - At the start of the Fight phase, if this model's unit is within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units and within 9\" of one or more other friendly **^^Genestealer Cults Character^^** units that are also within Engagement Range of one or more enemy units, this model's unit is not eligible to fight until after those other friendly **^^Genestealer Cults Character^^** units that are eligible to fight have done so."
      },
      "Battle Scar§Mental Failings": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Genestealer Cults"
          ]
        },
        "text": "Each time you target this model's unit with a Stratagem, roll one D6; on a 4+, until the end of the turn, you cannot target this model's unit with that Stratagem (do not spend any CP)."
      },
      "Battle Scar§Fractious Aggression": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": [
            "Genestealer Cults"
          ]
        },
        "text": "In your Charge phase, if this model's unit is eligible to declare a charge and is within 7\" of one or more enemy units, you must declare a charge with this model's unit."
      },
      "Requisition§Blessed Leader": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition when you add a GENESTEALER CULTS CHARACTER unit (excluding PATRIARCH units) that your Crusade force does not already include to your Order of Battle. If your Crusade force includes a PATRIARCH unit of at least Battle-hardened rank, that CHARACTER unit added to your Order of Battle gains 6XP (and therefore gains the Blooded rank); select one Battle Honour for it as normal."
      },
      "Requisition§Proficient Planning": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition before a Crusade battle. During that battle, you can use one of the following abilities once:\n\nLying in Wait: Use this ability when you set up an INFANTRY unit, other than during the Deploy Armies step. When you do, you can set that unit up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 3\" horizontally away from all enemy units. Until the end of the turn, that unit is not eligible to declare a charge.\n\nA Trap Sprung: Use this ability when you set up a unit, other than during the Deploy Armies step. When you do, until the end of the turn, when you make a Charge roll for that unit, roll one additional dice, then discard one of the dice.\n\nPerfect Ambush: Use this ability when you set up a unit, other than during the Deploy Armies step. When you do, select one enemy unit within 12\" of and visible to that unit. Until the end of the turn, the unit you selected cannot have the Benefit of Cover."
      },
      "Requisition§Beloved of the Cult": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition either before or after a Crusade battle. Select one GENESTEALER CULTS unit from your Crusade army with the Heroic rank or higher. That unit is upgraded to be beloved of the cult (make a note of on its Crusade card); add 1 to that units Crusade points.\n\nEach time a unit that is beloved of the cult gains 1 or more XP in a Crusade battle and survives that battle, after that battle, roll one D6 for each other unit from your Crusade army that survived that battle: on a 6, the unit you rolled for gains 1XP.\n\nOnly one unit from your Crusade army can be beloved of the cult at the same time; each time you use this Requisition, first remove that upgrade from any other unit from your army that has it, and subtract 1 from that previously upgraded unit’s Crusade points."
      },
      "Requisition§Flawless Incursion": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition after a Crusade battle, if your Crusade force is on a Path of Ascension. If all of the following apply, you gain 1 Ascension point:\n\nYou won that battle.\n\nEvery Agenda you selected for that battle was a Genestealer Cults Agenda.\n\nGENESTEALER CULTS units from your Crusade army earned XP from each of those Agendas.\n\nYou can only use this Requisition once after each Crusade battle."
      },
      "Requisition§The Cult Grows": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition after a Crusade battle, if your Crusade force is on a Path of Ascension. You can do one of the following (choose before making either roll):\n\nAdd 1 to your next Propagation roll.\n\nAdd 1 to your next Setback roll.\n\nYou can only use this Requisition once after each Crusade battle."
      },
      "Requisition§Purestrain": {
        "stats": {
          "RP": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "text": "Purchase this Requisition when your Control count increases to 3 for the first time, if your Crusade force is on a Path of Ascension. Add one PURESTRAIN GENESTEALERS unit to your Order of Battle. That unit gains 6XP (and therefore gains the Blooded rank); select one Battle Honour for it as normal.\n\nYou cannot purchase this Requisition if doing so would cause your total Power Level to exceed your Crusade forces Supply Limit."
      },
      "Crusade Badge§Uprising Hero": {
        "text": "You have successfully completed one Path of Ascension.\nYou have won at least two battles"
      },
      "Crusade Badge§Propagator of Liberation": {
        "text": "You are the architect of Ascension. The oppressors of one world after another have fallen to your masterful strategies and labyrinthine ploys. More than that, you have seeded the cult’s creed and the Patriarch’s progeny into the heavenly domains and wrested spaceports, ships and crews from the faithless to take the Star Childrens blessings still further. Now is not the moment to rest, for the divine labour cannot be laid down until the chains wielded by every tyrannical overlord lie broken with them.\nYou have successfully completed three Paths of Ascension.\nYou have won at least one Glorious Ascension victory.\nYou have won at least six battles"
      },
      "Crusade Badge§Saint of Ascension": {
        "text": "You have successfully completed five Paths of Ascension, on at least three different classifications of world.\nYou have won at least one Seed the Stars victory, one Glorious Ascension victory and one Great Ordeal victory.\nYou have won at least 10 battles.\nA CHARACTER from your Crusade force has reached Legendary rank."
      },
      "Cult Honour§Tactical Strategist": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Shrewd Strategy: your Crusade force gains 6 Planning points each battle to buy Shrewd Strategy abilities for GENESTEALER CULTS units (Crossfire 1, Suppressing Crossfire 2, Stealth 2, Booby Traps 2, Ambushing Crossfire 3, Vanishing Act 3; one ability per unit per battle, unspent points are lost). Shrewd Strategy: your Crusade force gains 6 Planning points each battle to buy Shrewd Strategy abilities for GENESTEALER CULTS units (Crossfire 1, Suppressing Crossfire 2, Stealth 2, Booby Traps 2, Ambushing Crossfire 3, Vanishing Act 3; one ability per unit per battle, unspent points are lost). Shrewd Strategy: your Crusade force gains 6 Planning points each battle to buy Shrewd Strategy abilities for GENESTEALER CULTS units (Crossfire 1, Suppressing Crossfire 2, Stealth 2, Booby Traps 2, Ambushing Crossfire 3, Vanishing Act 3; one ability per unit per battle, unspent points are lost). During the Select Crusade Blessings step, you can spend your Planning points to purchase one or more Shrewd Strategy abilities. All Planning points unspent at the end of this step are lost. Each time you purchase one of these abilities, select one **^^Genestealer Cults^^** unit in your Crusade army; until the end of the battle, that unit has that ability and the first time it is set up on the battlefield, place the relevant Shrewd Strategy ability token next to it to remind you (and your opponent) that you have upgraded that unit that battle. You can purchase the same Shrewd Strategy ability multiple times, but each unit cannot have more than one Shrewd Strategy ability per battle. Note that if a unit with a Shrewd Strategy ability is destroyed during the battle and a new identical unit is added to your Crusade army as a result of the Cult Ambush ability, that unit does not have the Shrewd Strategy abilities that the original unit had.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "Cult Honour§Beloved of the Cult": {
        "keywords": {
          "Tags": []
        },
        "text": "Beloved of the Cult Requisition (1RP): a GENESTEALER CULTS unit with the Heroic rank or higher; only one unit at a time. Beloved of the Cult Requisition (1RP): a GENESTEALER CULTS unit with the Heroic rank or higher; only one unit at a time. Beloved of the Cult Requisition (1RP): a GENESTEALER CULTS unit with the Heroic rank or higher; only one unit at a time. Each time a unit that is beloved of the cult gains 1 or more XP in a Crusade battle and survives that battle, after that battle, roll one D6 for each other unit from your Crusade army that survived that battle: on a 6, the unit you rolled for gains 1XP.",
        "stats": {
          "Crusade Pts": {
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        "rules": {
          "Heroic rank or higher.": {
            "evals": [
              {
                "actionable": true,
                "not": false,
                "operator": "AND",
                "paths": [
                  [
